---
title: Frost Alerts — Free Frost Alert App Near You
description: Frost Alerts is a free frost alert app. Get frost alerts near me, frost alerts for my area, and tips so you can prepare in time.
preloadImage: ./asset/frost-alert-hero.svg
homeLabel: Home page
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head %}

	<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
	<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }}" />
	<meta property="og:description"
		content="Get free frost alerts near you. Personalized frost alerts for your area and your city." />
	<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.domain }}{{ pagePath }}" />

	<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
	<meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ title }}" />
	<meta name="twitter:description"
		content="Free frost alerts for my area. Be notified before temperatures drop below zero." />
{%- endblock %}

{% block main %}
	<main>
		<section class="container py-5">
			<div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center py-lg-5">
				<article class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6 p-4 p-md-5">
					<img src="./asset/frost-alert-hero.svg" class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid"
						alt="A person next to a phone receiving a frost alert, with a thermometer dropping below freezing, a protected plant and a frosted car" width="600" height="278" />
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-6 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h1 class="fw-light">Anticipate frost</h1>
					<p class="lead text-muted">Receive a free alert when the weather forecast predicts negative
						temperatures in your area.</p>
					<p>
						<a href="./sign-up.html" class="btn btn-primary my-2">Sign up</a>
						<a href="./check-subscription.html" class="btn btn-outline-secondary my-2 ms-2">Check My
							Subscription</a>
						<a href="./feedback.html" class="btn btn-link my-2">Give us feedback</a>
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="py-5 bg-light">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row">
					<article class="col-lg-4 py-3 px-lg-4 py-lg-5">
						<h2>Personalized</h2>
						<p>Protect yourself against potential damage caused by frost: a frost warning is sent in
							advance, automatically, when a frost episode is forecast near you.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-4 py-3 px-lg-4 py-lg-5">
						<h2>Free of charge</h2>
						<p>We analyze the weather predictions for the coming days for you, free of charge.</p>
						<p>No registration fees or hidden costs. No ads.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-4 py-3 px-lg-4 py-lg-5">
						<h2>Simple</h2>
						<p>Enter your contact details and your city &mdash; anywhere in the world.
							You will only be alerted in case of frost, no other commercial solicitations.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="py-5">
			<div class="container">
				<h2 id="faq-heading" class="fw-light mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
				<div class="row">
					<article class="col-lg-6 mb-3">
						<h3 class="h5">How do I get frost alerts near me?</h3>
						<p>Sign up with your city and country. We'll send free frost alerts near you when forecasts
							predict temperatures close to or below 0°C.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-6 mb-3">
						<h3 class="h5">Can I receive frost alerts for my area only?</h3>
						<p>Yes. Alerts are personalized to your area, so you only get notified when frost is expected
							around your location.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-6 mb-3">
						<h3 class="h5">Will it help protect frost-sensitive outdoors appliances or plants?
						</h3>
						<p>Yes. A timely frost alert helps you take action to protect your outdoor appliances.</p>
						<p>A frost warning sent in advance helps you cover plants or move pots before a cold
							snap.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-6 mb-3">
						<h3 class="h5">Are frost alerts available for my city?</h3>
						<p>Yes. Frost Alerts are available for any city worldwide, thanks to our global weather data
							provider.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="col-lg-6 mb-3">
						<h3 class="h5">Is this a free frost alert app?</h3>
						<p>Yes, Frost Alerts is free. No other commercial solicitations from us.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	{% include "partials/en/footer.njk" %}

